        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13001.txt",
        "text_sha256": "a4cdf39399ad61c9f8037ccad837fc8969cdac1aeb9d5b91372a742db22ee5f0",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-05-10/pdf/96-11966.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of Emergency Board (‘‘Board’’). There is established\neffective May 8, 1996, a Board of three members to be appointed by the\nPresident to investigate the dispute. No member shall be pecuniarily or\notherwise interested in any organization of railroad employees or any railroad\ncarrier. The Board shall perform its functions subject to the availability\nof funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2213,
      "char_start": 2098,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13001#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13001#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "61 FR 21943, PDF pages 1-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "2d7e68ff42761818562c408895db9e9918b46b8e9a29fc0626e801f735bb9e27",
        "signing_date": "1996-05-08",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13001.txt",
        "text_sha256": "a4cdf39399ad61c9f8037ccad837fc8969cdac1aeb9d5b91372a742db22ee5f0",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-05-10/pdf/96-11966.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report. The Board shall report to the President with respect to\nthe dispute within 30 days of its creation."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2540,
      "char_start": 2214,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13001#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13001#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "61 FR 21943, PDF pages 1-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "2d7e68ff42761818562c408895db9e9918b46b8e9a29fc0626e801f735bb9e27",
        "signing_date": "1996-05-08",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13001.txt",
        "text_sha256": "a4cdf39399ad61c9f8037ccad837fc8969cdac1aeb9d5b91372a742db22ee5f0",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-05-10/pdf/96-11966.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Maintaining Conditions. As provided by section 10 of the Act, from\nthe date of the creation of the Board and for 30 days after the Board\nhas made its report to the President, no change, except by agreement of\nthe parties shall be made by the railroads or the employees in the conditions\nout of which the dispute arose."
    },
    {
