        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-05-10/pdf/96-11966.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 4. Records Maintenance. The records and files of the Board are records\nof the Office of the President and upon the Board’s termination shall be\nmaintained in the physical custody of the National Mediation Board."
    },
